      {
        "n": "AFRICA ONLY PRESENTS CAPE VERDEAN UNDERGROUND W/ KLRA, DÉCIO, DJ DORAEMON, DJ FREDSON & EUROBABE",
        "s": "2026-11-03T18:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-11-03T19:00:00Z",
        "d": "Africa Only is an ongoing cultural and musical project exploring underground sounds, scenes and artistic movements across the African continent and the diaspora. Curated by the artist Paxslim, the series highlights artists, communities and sonic histories rooted in African and Afro-diasporic identity. Each episode focuses on a different scene, bringing together music, research and storytelling to spotlight emerging and influential voices shaping contemporary underground culture.\nFrom the host: \"Featuring selections from Cape Verdean diaspora DJs and producers Décio, DJ Doraemon, DJ Fredson, Eurobabe and KLRA. Moving between Coladeira, Morna, Kizomba, Funaná, Cotxi Po, Batida and Kuduro, they celebrate the diversity of Cape Verdean music and its role in reclaiming cultural roots.\"",
        "j": null,
        "u": "https://www.nts.live/api/v2/shows/paxslim/episodes/paxslim-3rd-november-2026"
